nk":"/explore/intro"},"next":{"title":"🇮🇳 Auroville in India","permalink":"/explore/auroville"}},{"id":"guides/research","title":"Guidelines + tips for a research (draft)","description":"What is a research?","source":"@site/../docs/guides/research.md","sourceDirName":"guides","slug":"/guides/research","permalink":"/guides/research","draft":false,"unlisted":false,"editUrl":"https://github.com/ONEARMY/project-kamp-academy/blob/master/../docs/guides/research.md","tags":[],"version":"current","frontMatter":{"id":"research","title":"Guidelines + tips for a research (draft)","sidebar_label":"Add Research"}},{"id":"index","title":"Project Kamp Academy","description":"Good to see you here in our Project Kamp Academy. This is the place where we share our developments and steps forward to setup Project Kamp. How to research, how to buy land, how to prototype etc. But before we go in depth, here is a quick overview where we are currently at.","source":"@site/../docs/index.md","sourceDirName":".","slug":"/","permalink":"/","draft":false,"unlisted":false,"editUrl":"https://github.com/ONEARMY/project-kamp-academy/blob/master/../docs/index.md","tags":[],"version":"current","frontMatter":{"id":"index","title":"Project Kamp Academy","slug":"/"},"sidebar":"docs","next":{"title":"Start exploring","permalink":"/explore/intro"}},{"id":"land/buy","title":"Buying land","description":"Big update coming to the Academy April 2027. Stay tuned 🔥","source":"@site/../docs/land/buy.md","sourceDirName":"land","slug":"/land/buy","permalink":"/land/buy","draft":false,"unlisted":false,"editUrl":"https://github.com/ONEARMY/project-kamp-academy/blob/master/../docs/land/buy.md","tags":[],"version":"current","frontMatter":{"id":"buy","title":"Buying land"},"sidebar":"docs","previous":{"title":"Share your idea","permalink":"/land/share"},"next":{"title":"Introduction","permalink":"/basekamp/intro"}},{"id":"land/share","title":"Share your idea","description":"Big update coming to the Academy April 2027. Stay tuned 🔥","source":"@site/../docs/land/share.md","sourceDirName":"land","slug":"/land/share","permalink":"/land/share","draft":false,"unlisted":false,"editUrl":"https://github.com/ONEARMY/project-kamp-academy/blob/master/../docs/land/share.md","tags":[],"version":"current","frontMatter":{"id":"share","title":"Share your idea"},"sidebar":"docs","previous":{"title":"🇮🇳 Life in a Krishna temple","permalink":"/explore/krishna"},"next":{"title":"Buying land","permalink":"/land/buy"}},{"id":"start/intro","title":"Hello ✋","description":"Good to see you here in our Project Kamp Academy. This is the place where we share our developments and steps forward to setup Project Kamp. How to research, how to buy land, how to prototype etc. But before we go in depth, here is a quick overview where we are currently at.","source":"@site/../docs/start/intro.md","sourceDirName":"start","slug":"/start/intro","permalink":"/start/intro","draft":false,"unlisted":false,"editUrl":"https://github.com/ONEARMY/project-kamp-academy/blob/master/../docs/start/intro.md","tags":[],"version":"current","frontMatter":{"id":"intro","title":"Hello ✋"}},{"id":"support/chat","title":"Chat and Support","description":"Project Kamp is part of One Army, a group of people trying to tackle global problems. We use Discord to chat, learn from each other and answer questions. Besides the practical stuff it's also a great place to meet like-minded people and get inspired by other projects. Have a look, join our +10.000 people Discord and get in touch with the community!","source":"@site/../docs/support/chat.md","sourceDirName":"support","slug":"/support/chat","permalink":"/support/chat","draft":false,"unlisted":false,"editUrl":"https://github.com/ONEARMY/project-kamp-academy/blob/master/../docs/support/chat.md","tags":[],"version":"current","frontMatter":{"id":"chat","title":"Chat and Support","sidebar_label":"💬 Chat"},"sidebar":"docs","previous":{"title":"👕 Merch","permalink":"/support/merch"}},{"id":"support/download","title":"Download Kit","description":"Project Kamp is just getting started. The download kit is small and in the early stages. But hey, you got to start somewhere. So here you can download everything we got so far. Thank you for seeing potential this early on, keeps us motivated to continue development! :)","source":"@site/../docs/support/download.md","sourceDirName":"support","slug":"/support/download","permalink":"/support/download","draft":false,"unlisted":false,"editUrl":"https://github.com/ONEARMY/project-kamp-academy/blob/master/../docs/support/download.md","tags":[],"version":"current","frontMatter":{"id":"download","title":"Download Kit","sidebar_label":"📦 Download-kit"},"sidebar":"docs","previous":{"title":"Latest update","permalink":"/updates/"},"next":{"title":"👕 Merch","permalink":"/support/merch"}},{"id":"support/merch","title":"Spikey Booshes Merch","description":"After lots of requests from our community we finally made it! SPIKEY BOOSHES merch. Well sort of, we explain more about it in update #118 . In short we don't like the idea of shipping t-shirts around the world since it has a large environmental impact. (even though it would be a good source of income) We believe there are other creative/less wasteful ways to achieve this. Have a look at fixing.fashion for more information about the issues with the fashion industry and what to do about it. For now we've made an spikey bushes illustration and added a bunch of different files that you can use to stitch, carve, press. Download the package below for free. Share what you made with it on #spikeybooshes","source":"@site/../docs/support/merch.md","sourceDirName":"support","slug":"/support/merch","permalink":"/support/merch","draft":false,"unlisted":false,"editUrl":"https://github.com/ONEARMY/project-kamp-academy/blob/master/../docs/support/merch.md","tags":[],"version":"current","frontMatter":{"id":"merch","title":"Spikey Booshes Merch","sidebar_label":"👕 Merch"},"sidebar":"docs","previous":{"ti